#: 74b79d30996c4eeb8fdce8305af1e7d0
msgid ""
"Modifier les emplacements/visibilité (dans les Espaces Collaboratifs), "
"voir : « Modifier les Emplacements/Visibilité »"
msgstr ""
"Editing location/sharing (in Collaborative Spaces), see: “Editing "
"Location/Sharing”"

#: ../../docs-gofast-users/doc-gofast-guide-utilisateurs_1.rst:857
