"sélectionner tous les contenus de l’emplacement où vous vous trouvez en "
"un clic dans la case qui se trouve tout en haut de la liste des contenus."
msgstr ""
"To select multiple documents in the File Explorer, you must click the "
"boxes to the left of the file titles (in the main area of the File "
"Explorer). You can select all content from the location you are in with "
"one click in the box at the top of the content list."

#: ../../docs-gofast-users/doc-gofast-guide-utilisateurs_2.rst:808
#: 24eca7b5b50447e291693e8cae55497a
