msgstr "Card creation"

#: ../../docs-gofast-users/doc-gofast-guide-utilisateurs_3.rst:1136
#: ../../docs-gofast-users/doc-gofast-guide-utilisateurs_3.rst:1138
#: ../../docs-gofast-users/doc-gofast-guide-utilisateurs_3.rst:1140
